{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128120811632-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128140347\"/><p>解款車撞向路旁大樹。</p><p>屯門發生交通意外。今日(28日)早上11時16分，一輛解款車駛至屯門鄉事會路近屯隆街交界時，失控撞向路旁一棵大樹。解款車車頭損毀，大樹被撞至傾側，救護車接報到場將受傷清醒司機送院，人員身穿避彈衣持槍戒備，並圍封現場調查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:34:39.898528+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T04:08:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T13:32:44.831166+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:28:18.284411+00:00","content_hash":"682bc4bf4d41021d63fcfb36a9eddbe2c70bb13ea5a6f252ba802c3588c4f910","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}